# POE-terrain-captures: the level-generator corpus of the POESniffer work tree, mounted as the
# submodule `captures/` of https://github.com/andromeda-strain/POESniffer.
#
# Tracked: one folder per captured load (`<Area name> - <internal id> - <seed>/`: the tracer's
# stage csv, the truth grid, the sim exports, the walkability dumps and renders), the September
# `_unfiled/` captures, and `cases/` (index.tsv, sim_report.tsv, the harvest tables, post_session.log).
# Ignored: the capture loop's regenerable top-level summaries and renders.

# the automatic capture loop: generated layouts and summaries are regenerable; the stage captures (.csv) are corpus data
/*.png
/*.tsv
/auto_*.txt
/cases/*/grid_read.log
/*.log
/*_truth_*.tsv
/pipeline_*.json
/walk_*
/terrain_*
/cases/*/walk_*.png

# sniffer / tracer side files
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
*.bak-*
*.bak_*
session_*.json
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.zip
